    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Murphy Mullan Estate Agents are delighted to bring to market 123 Southmede, a truly stunning 2 bed first floor apartment in this ever popular development in Dundrum.  No.123 provides an excellent opportunity for a first time buyer, someone looking to downsize or an investor given its easy access to the city centre, universities and business campus's of south Dublin. \r\n\r\nSouthmede is located just a few minutes stroll from Dundrum Shopping Centre and enjoy all the amenities of this hugely popular location including an abundance of shops, bars, restaurants to suit all tastes. The Luas at Balally is located a 10 minute walk away providing easy access to the city centre, the M50 is just a 5 minute drive and provides easy access to all the major national routes and Dublin airport. Marley and Balally Parks are both just a short stroll away and offer scenic walks for any new owner to enjoy.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation briefly comprises: entrance hall, hot press, utility / storage press, kitchen with integrated appliances, a light filled living /dining room, 2 double bedrooms and family bathroom.\r\n\r\nThis property is a great opportunity to own a fantastic home or investment and must be seen to be appreciated."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Highly sought after location.\r\n10 minute walk to Balally Luas Stop..\r\nExcellent condition throughout.\r\nC.667sqft.\r\nGas fired central heating.\r\nGated secure parking.\r\nOne large car parking space (Suitable for two cars)\r\nBalcony"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: C2"
      }
